    "description": "The Business Central server caches primary-key reads within a transaction. Repeated Record.Get(<primary key>) calls for the same key are served from that cache rather than re-queried, so a guarded if not Rec.Get(...) then exit; inside a per-row helper is not a genuine N+1 pattern.",
